       dates _*_a_r_g_z and _*_a_r_g_z___l_e_n.

       aarrggzz__aadddd__sseepp()  is  similar,  but splits the string _s_t_r into substrings
       separated by the delimiter _d_e_l_i_m.  For example, one might use this on a
       UNIX search path with delimiter ':'.

